{"id":"G4727","lema":"στενάζω","lemaStrong":"στενάζω","translit":"stenázō","pron":"","glosa":"gemir, suspirar con peso","defStrong":"to make (intransitively, be) in straits, i.e. (by implication) to sigh, murmur, pray inaudibly","defKjv":"with grief, groan, grudge, sigh","derivacion":"from G4728 (στενός);","veces":6,"versos":6,"refs":["Mr 7:34","Ro 8:23","2 Co 5:2","2 Co 5:4","He 13:17","Stg 5:9"],"texto":"Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894)"}